   122	The profile identity `hardened-profile-v1` is bound one-to-one to that
   123	execution-policy identity and appears in markers and claims, not in the hashed
   124	input. The `hardened-tcb-v1` record and the enforcement-backend identity appear
   125	in markers and claims, are never hashed into a build identity, and never enter a
