   199	## Compatibility impact
   200	
   201	Additive in both directions. Schemas 1 through 7, receipt schemas 1 and 2,
   202	marker schemas 1 through 3, claim schemas 1 through 3, the portable execution
   203	policy, the portable native-control inventory, the portable capability-evidence
   204	record, the six portable diagnostics, and every byte of `conformance/v1`,
   205	`schemas/v1`, and `release/1.0.0-rc.5.json` are unchanged.
   206	
   207	The package surface is unchanged. No manifest field, descriptor field, build
   208	command field, environment variable, or out-of-band file selects, weakens, or
   209	observes any part of this profile.
