   475	### 6.3 Platform declarations
   476	
   477	A platform declaration binds one platform to one enforcement backend, the public
   478	primitives that backend would use per capability class, a qualification status,
   479	and the task that owns qualification. The declarations are normative; their
   480	executable form is the `platform_declarations` section of
   481	`conformance/hardened/v1/vectors/hardened-execution-profile.json`.
   482	
   483	| Platform | Enforcement backend | Qualification status |
   484	|---|---|---|
   485	| `linux` | `linux-namespace-seccomp-v1` | `unqualified` |
   486	| `macos` | `macos-sandbox-v1` | `unqualified` |
   487	| `windows` | `windows-appcontainer-job-v1` | `unqualified` |
